0.09 0.20 0.17 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 54 685 Td (Overview) Tj ET 0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 662 Td (Added a NestJS authentication backend for the admin panel using email and password,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 648 Td (Prisma 7, MySQL, and secure browser sessions. Authentication is required for API routes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 634 Td (unless a route is explicitly public.) Tj ET
0.09 0.20 0.17 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 54 623 Td (Backend changes) Tj ET 0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 600 Td (- Global Nest authentication guard protects routes by default; POST /auth/sign-in is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 586 Td (- explicitly public.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570 Td (- POST /auth/sign-in validates credentials, checks that the account is an ADMIN, verifies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (- the password hash, and creates a signed-in session. Invalid credentials receive a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (- generic error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 526 Td (- GET /auth/me returns the currently authenticated admin. POST /auth/sign-out ends the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (- current session.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 496 Td (- The authentication package uses an HttpOnly session cookie, so browser JavaScript cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (- read the session token.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (- Sessions are stored in MySQL in the new AuthSession table and are linked to User) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 452 Td (- records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 436 Td (- Password hashing uses Nest authentication package scrypt hashing; older hashes are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (- upgraded after successful sign-in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 406 Td (- CORS is configured for the local frontend and the backend defaults to port 3001.) Tj ET
0.09 0.20 0.17 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 54 397 Td (Admin account seed) Tj ET 0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (Run npm run seed:admin from the backend folder. The command builds the backend, loads) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (backend/.env, and ensures an administrator exists.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (- Set ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD in the actual backend/.env file; .env.example is only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 328 Td (- a template.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (- Use a password of at least 12 characters. The seed rejects missing settings or invalid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298 Td (- values rather than using a built-in password.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (- If the email is new, the seed creates the account. If it belongs to an existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268 Td (- customer, the account is promoted without replacing its password. It is safe to rerun.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 252 Td (- The backend also ensures this configured admin account at startup.) Tj ET
0.09 0.20 0.17 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 54 243 Td (Database changes) Tj ET 0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 220 Td (- New users default to the ADMIN role in the Prisma schema.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 204 Td (- A migration creates AuthSession with session expiry, activity, optional MFA state,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (- metadata, and a cascading User relation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 174 Td (- The migration was applied to the local MySQL database and Prisma reported the schema up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (- to date.) Tj ET
